# Little Navmap replica, its incoming/upload files and SQLite side files.
navdata.db.lnm*
# Patterns here match from the context root, so **/ is needed to match
# dropped Little Navmap databases (Navigraph-licensed) in subdirectories.
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-journal
**/*.sqlite-wal
**/*.sqlite-shm
# Same patterns for every letter case of the extension (.SQLITE, .Sqlite),
# which the server-path import accepts.
**/*.[sS][qQ][lL][iI][tT][eE]
**/*.[sS][qQ][lL][iI][tT][eE]-journal
**/*.[sS][qQ][lL][iI][tT][eE]-wal
**/*.[sS][qQ][lL][iI][tT][eE]-shm
# Agent run clones and scratch directories can hold licensed copies.
.claude/
